# Build output
build/
.gradle/

# Local Gradle distribution (130MB, re-downloadable via tools/ bootstrap)
tools/gradle-*/
tools/gradle.zip

# Capture history: keep the contact sheets, drop the individual frames.
# Contact sheets are what progress.html embeds and what reviews are argued
# from, so the iteration-to-iteration comparison the brief asks for is fully
# preserved. Individual full-res frames are working artefacts for close
# inspection during a single pass and lose their value once that pass is
# judged -- and they are 55MB per ~100 frames, which would reach gigabytes
# over the number of passes this project expects.
out/**/frame_*.png
